in levelF_stress: present and\.w #64\n\tsta \d+,s\n\tcmp\.w #0\n\tbne \+\n\tlda (\d+),s\n\tsta (\d+),s\n\tjmp @if_false\.\d+\n\+\n@if_true\.\d+:\n\tlda \d+,s\n\tora \1,s\n\tsta \d+,s\n\tsta \2,s\n[\s\S]*?\tlda \2,s\n\tsta \1,s\n[\s\S]*?jmp @while_cond
in levelF_stress: present and\.w #128\n\tsta \d+,s\n\tcmp\.w #0\n\tbne \+\n\tlda (\d+),s\n\tsta (\d+),s\n\tjmp @if_false\.\d+\n\+\n@if_true\.\d+:\n\tlda \d+,s\n\tclc\n\tadc \1,s\n\tsta \d+,s\n\tsta \2,s\n[\s\S]*?\tlda \2,s\n\tsta \1,s\n[\s\S]*?jmp @while_cond
# levelF, nested: b |= raw only under (raw & 1) && (raw & 0x100). Outer
# false path: b -> outer merge (\2); inner merge (\3) -> outer merge;
# outer merge -> b on the back edge.
in levelF_stress: present and\.w #1\n\tsta \d+,s\n\tcmp\.w #0\n\tbne \+\n\tlda (\d+),s\n\tsta (\d+),s\n\tlda \d+,s\n\tsta \d+,s\n\tjmp @if_false\.\d+\n[\s\S]*?and\.w #256\n[\s\S]*?ora \1,s\n\tsta \d+,s\n\tsta (\d+),s\n[\s\S]*?\tlda \3,s\n\tsta \2,s\n[\s\S]*?\tlda \2,s\n\tsta \1,s\n[\s\S]*?jmp @while_cond
# Frame sizes: 106 and 134 bytes until the slot colouring of 2026-09-27
# (temps with disjoint lives share a slot), 62 and 72 since. The pairing
# checks above are the point of this fixture and hold at either size.
# 36 and 44 since 2026-10-08: the locals the optimizer promoted to temps
# no longer keep their words of frame.
in levelE_many_acc: present sbc\.w #36\n
in levelF_stress: present sbc\.w #44\n
